    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεισήπους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>projecting end of rafter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				22.463.51
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεισηπόδισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, ib.<i><span class="en">
				114
			</span></i>: the spellings <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεισίποδες</span></b>  (<i><span class="en">
