				1.81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				227
			</span></i>), <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεισιπόδ-ισμα</span></b>  and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γειο-ίζω</span></b>  (<i>support
				the cornice</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				113
			</span></i>) are less correct.</div>
